  "instructions": [
    "In a small bowl, whisk together canola oil, honey, paprika, salt, and black pepper to make the glaze.",
    "Place the chopped cucumber, tomato, red onion, feta cheese, and fresh parsley in a bowl.",
    "Add the horiatiki seasoning and stir to combine.",
    "Drizzle the glaze over the salad and toss to coat.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 10 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Just before serving, stir in the chilled low-fat Greek yogurt.",
    "Serve chilled, garnished with additional fresh parsley if desired."
  ],
